                    "description": "Special Assistance 2024 Onwards",
                    "note": "If you have any accessibility accommodations that you require whilst you are in \nresort, such as an adapted room, accessible transfers etc, please do let our Virgin\nAtlantic Holidays Special Assistance team know. More information can be found \nhere: https://www.virginholidays.co.uk/travelplus/important/special-assistance\nAdditionally, if you do have any medical conditions that may be affected by air \ntravel, please do contact the operating airline who will be able to arrange \nassistance for you on your flights.",
